"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids came in under 90% of normal in May to June in 33 of 75 years since 1951. On that middle, August to September 2025 ran 50% of normal and July to August 2025 ran 63%. Grid 29629 shows a preliminary estimate of 70.2 for August to September 2026, and its driest year was 1956 at 71%.</p>"}
